OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 27, arrested over hit-and-run
OL,4,Adeath in Linlithgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 27-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter the death of a pedestrian in a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run crash in West Lothian.
OL,10,FThe 48-year-old man died at the scene
OL,11,Fof the incident on Main Street,
OL,12,FLinlithgow, at about 00:20 on Sunday
OL,14,FPolice Scotland had been trying to
OL,15,Ftrace the occupants of the grey Renault
OL,16,FClio involved in the crash.
OL,18,FThe force said its inquiries were
OL,19,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
